d you as his last words echo through the void....\n \nZORK III: The Dungeon Master\nCopyright 1982 by Infocom, Inc. All rights reserved.\nZORK is a trademark of Infocom, Inc.\nRelease 17 / Serial number 840727\n \nEndless Stair\nYou are at the bottom of a seemingly endless stair, winding its way upward beyond your vision. An eerie light, coming from all around you, casts strange shadows on the walls. To the south is a dark and winding trail.\nYour old friend, the brass lantern, is at your feet.\n \n> \n➤\n🎤\nZork 3\nThe Dungeon Master\nBy Infocom\nMap controls\nCenter\n-\n100%\n+\nMaps\nReset Map\n2 rooms / 3 exits / 0 notes\nIN\nUP\nNW\nN\nNE\nW\nEndless Stair\nE\nSW\nS\nSE\nDOWN\nOUT\nKNOWN ROOMS\nEndless StairJunction\nNotes\nParchLock! build 72\nMenu","steps":[{"cmd":"talk to lamp","reply":">talk to lamp You can't talk to the lamp!   > ","room":64,"player":202,"diff":[]},{"cmd":"lamp, hello","reply":">lamp, hello You can't talk to the lamp!   > ","room":64,"player":202,"diff":[]},{"cmd":"talk to myself","reply":">talk to myself You can't talk to the you!   > ","room":64,"player":202,"diff":[]},{"cmd":"GET LAMP","reply":">GET LAMP Taken.   > ","room":64,"player":202,"diff":[{"id":198,"n":"lamp","before":{"n":"lamp","p":64,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"lamp","p":202,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"S","reply":">S It is pitch black. You are likely to be eaten by a grue.   > ","room":63,"player":202,"diff":[{"id":202,"n":"cretin","before":{"n":"cretin","p":64,"c":0,"o":0,"a":1},"after":{"n":"cretin","p":63,"c":0,"o":0,"a":1}}]},{"cmd":"LIGHT LAMP","reply":">LIGHT LAMP The lamp is now on.   Junction You are at the junction of a north-south passage and an east-west passage. To the north, you can make out the bottom of a stairway. The ways to the east and south are relatively cramped, but a wider trail leads to the west. Standing before you is a great rock. Imbedded within it is an Elvish sword.   > ","room":63,"player":202,"diff":[]},{"cmd":"E","reply":">E Damp Passag